+"""EXE-01: a book-level response only for book-level evidence — the watchdog's PROPORTIONALITY GATE (R-14 read as A, ON).
+
+*** MOCK ONLY: MockBroker, temp state dirs, pilot_log trees built in tmp. No venue, no credentials, no network, nothing
+    written under state/. ***
+
+THE DEFECT (quant_research docs/fixprogram_2026-09-13/FX_W6C/FACT_TABLE_W6C.md): every trip ran the same ladder — halt,
+cancel, flatten EVERY position — whatever fired. On the live record 5 of 10 whole-book flattens came from triggers whose
+evidence was a handful of named symbols; 4 of those were two-name events at 0.42–1.84% of gross (08-01 and 09-12 our own
+instruments, 08-21 and 08-26 real two-name venue changes). The user's rules (2026-09-12: instrument doubt must never
+trigger a book-level response, a book-level response must pass a proportionality gate; 2026-09-13: fix known issues
+without waiting) settle the ruling R-14 as option A, switch ON, with the frozen 2% / 5-name thresholds.
+
+WHAT THIS SUITE PROVES, on this tree:
+  [A]  the headline and its neighbours, through `watchdog.run` on a held MockBroker book — a single-name §4-5b/§4-5e/§4-7
+       set flattens THAT name only (the base ef60f85 flattens all 100 names — red for the right reason); 4/5/6 names;
+       1.999 / 2.000 / 2.001% of gross; the union across classes; book-level triggers beside a named set; unknown doubt
+       and unknown gross; the real 2026-09-12 12Z rows re-shaped so (a)(b) keeps the contradiction; the config switch off.
+  [N]  negative controls: §4-2 day loss, §4-4b leverage, §4-5a outage and §4-5c account-side anomaly on the same held
+       book still flatten EVERY name and set reduce-only (green on both trees by design).
+  [B]  the local action itself (cancel-before-flatten on the named names only, re-read + retry, unreadable positions,
+       refused flatten, a standing trip not overwritten), the EMA reset exemption, the page composition and its tier,
+       reconcile's order-independent doubt (review C9), the kind-agnostic source pins, the unreadable-book equality probe,
+       the 09-09 receipt's name sets.
+WHAT IT DOES NOT PROVE: the venue's behaviour for reduce-only market exits during -4400 / price protection (MockBroker);
+that the off-box page is DELIVERED (run_anchor's wiring is pinned statically here, delivery is the anchor's receipt);
+`ops/resume_from_trip.sh` / `ops/unseed_rehearsal_halt.py` end to end (both run a public network probe — their refusal
+branches are pinned statically, the EMA keep/remove snippet is executed verbatim); that 2% / 5 are the right numbers
+(policy, set after the incident, frozen).
+
+Old-code proof: this file on ef60f85 (`/Users/haosiyu/cc_tmp/fx_w6c_base`) must reach its summary line — every new name
+is looked up with getattr — and fail the [A]/[B] cells for the right reason (the whole book flattened / no local response).
+
+Exit 0 = all pass.
